    "project": "research/support_gaussian_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "SupportGaussianAudit.support_gaussian_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem support_gaussian_certificate : (∀ a : ℝ, 0<a → Summable (gaussianTerm a) ∧ Summable (fun v : ℕ × ℕ => exp (-a*((v.1 : ℝ)^2+(v.2 : ℝ)^2))) ∧ doubleGaussian a=(theta a)^2 ∧ doubleGaussian a<1/(1-exp (-a))^2 ∧ ¬ doubleGaussian a=1/(1-exp (-a))^2) ∧ (∀ (p t : ℕ) (ε c B : ℝ), 0<p → 0<t → 0<ε → 0<c → printedExponentThree p t ε c=(t : ℝ)*c*(ε/2)/(4*(p : ℝ)) ∧ 0<printedExponentThree p t ε c ∧ B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε*doubleGaussian (printedExponentThree p t ε c) < B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε/(1-exp (-printedExponentThree p t ε c))^2 ∧ B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε*doubleGaussian (printedExponentThree p t ε c) ≤ B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε/(1-exp (-printedExponentThree p t ε c))^2 ∧ ¬ B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε*doubleGaussian (printedExponentThree p t ε c) = B+printedSeriesCoefficient p ε/(1-exp (-printedExponentThree p t ε c))^2) ∧ (∀ a : ℝ, 0<a → Summable (gaussianInteger a) ∧ (∑' z : ℤ, gaussianInteger a z) ≤ sqrt (Real.pi/a) ∧ ∀ S : Finset ℤ, 0 ∉ S → (∑ z ∈ S, exp (-a*(z : ℝ)^2)) ≤ sqrt (Real.pi/a)) ∧ (¬ Summable (gaussianTerm 0)) ∧ (¬ (∑ z ∈ ({1} : Finset ℤ), exp (-(0 : ℝ)*(z : ℝ)^2)) ≤ sqrt (Real.pi/(0 : ℝ))) ∧ (∀ (X : Type) [Fintype X] (d : ℕ) (h : d ≤ Fintype.card X) (H : Fin d → X → ℝ), (∀ i x, 0 ≤ H i x) → injectiveProductExpectation X d h H = (∑ e : Sample X d, ∏ i, H i (e i))/((Fintype.card X).descFactorial d : ℝ) ∧ injectiveProductExpectation X d h H ≤ (∏ i, ∑ x, H i x)/((Fintype.card X).descFactorial d : ℝ)) ∧ (∀ (I : Type) [Fintype I] [Nonempty I] (q : PMF I), (∀ i, 0<weight q i) → ∃ ω : ℝ, 0<ω ∧ (∀ i, ω ≤ weight q i) ∧ ∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (a : I → ZMod p) (r : I) (j : ZMod p) (t : ℕ) (x : ZMod p), Complex.normSq (complexExpectation (kernelLaw q (fun i y => y+a i) t x) (frequencyCharacter p j)) ≤ exp (-(8*ω^2*(t : ℝ))*centeredRadius a r j))",
    "decl_sha256": "ea36a9f58e9ab88db16a3ee051fda3460c55e793deb152b798b0543c30c18f61",
    "scope": "Convergent literal two-dimensional Gaussian versus geometric equality counter at allowed k3 in Hildebrand original1994p199/author preprint PDF17, with faithful real-power exponent and positive printed1.1epsilon/(2p) coefficient; direct equality negation and valid upper-inequality repair. Qualified mixing theorem is not refuted. Gaussian summability and positive-tail integral test derive zero-excluded integer sum<=sqrt(pi/a), actual finite subset bound and zero-exponent nonsummability/finite-bound negative controls. Actual uniform injective-sample nonnegative product expectation equals actual product sum divided by descending factorial and is at most product of coordinate sums over that denominator, without a coordinate-independence assumption. Actual centered-character Jordan lower distance plus actual normalized PMF phase variance derives all-time eigenvalue/actual iid walk moment exponential decay; strictly positive constant is derived solely from fixed positive label PMF before modulus/support/frequency/time/start. Full support-average mixing exponent remains open. Standard foundations/default settings; no holes/custom axioms/native evaluation/raised limits/global flags/waivers/native experiment/spend/upload. No novelty or absence claim.",
